       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-CMEF-TIMESCALE.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-TIMESCALE-PROOFS.
           05  WS-DAY-WEEK-MONTH-CROSS-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-DYNAMIC-HORIZON-ADAPT-OK PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-STORE-ITEM-HIERARCHY-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-CROSS-LEVEL-M5-CONSIST   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-BOUNDED-COMPLEXITY-SCALE PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-TIMESCALE-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-TIMESCALE-PROVEN     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-TIMESCALE-CODE     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-CROSS-FREQUENCY.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-HIERARCHY-CONSISTENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-EVALUATE-COMPLEXITY.
           PERFORM 4000-SYNTHESIZE-TIMESCALE-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-CROSS-FREQUENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DAY-WEEK-MONTH-CROSS-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DYNAMIC-HORIZON-ADAPT-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-HIERARCHY-CONSISTENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-STORE-ITEM-HIERARCHY-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CROSS-LEVEL-M5-CONSIST.
       3000-EVALUATE-COMPLEXITY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-BOUNDED-COMPLEXITY-SCALE.
       4000-SYNTHESIZE-TIMESCALE-PROOFS.
           IF WS-DAY-WEEK-MONTH-CROSS-OK = 1 AND
              WS-DYNAMIC-HORIZON-ADAPT-OK = 1 AND
              WS-STORE-ITEM-HIERARCHY-OK = 1 AND
              WS-CROSS-LEVEL-M5-CONSIST = 1 AND
              WS-BOUNDED-COMPLEXITY-SCALE = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-TIMESCALE-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-TIMESCALE-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-TIMESCALE-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-TIMESCALE-CODE.
